# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Vulnerability & Misconfiguration Ignore Policy (.trivyignore)
# Target Architecture: Enterprise AWS Three-Tier Workload (ap-south-1)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) Policy Exceptions
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0053 / AWS-0053
# Title: Load balancer listener configured with HTTP protocol (redirect to HTTPS)
AVD-AWS-0053
AWS-0053

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0004 / AWS-0004
# Title: S3 bucket without MFA delete enabled
AVD-AWS-0004
AWS-0004

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0028 / AWS-0028
# Title: Instance does not require IMDS access to require a token
AVD-AWS-0028
AWS-0028

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0104 / AWS-0104
# Title: Security group rule allows unrestricted egress to any IP address (Required for NAT/APIs)
AVD-AWS-0104
AWS-0104

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0132 / AWS-0132
# Title: Bucket does not encrypt data with a customer managed key (SSE-S3 AES256 used instead of KMS CMK)
AVD-AWS-0132
AWS-0132

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0095 / AWS-0095
# Title: SNS Topic does not have encryption enabled
AVD-AWS-0095
AWS-0095

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0011 / AWS-0011
# Title: Distribution does not utilize a WAF (Skipped in test/dev tiers to reduce AWS cost)
AVD-AWS-0011
AWS-0011

# Rule: AVD-AWS-0164 / AWS-0164
# Title: Subnet associates public IP address (Required for public ingress tier)
AVD-AWS-0164
AWS-0164

